  "temporalCoverage": "1991/1992",
  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: For C:N, biogenic silicate, CaCO3: subsamples of one sample, collected at P26, are analyzed with each set of data to check for continuity. Zooplankton that likely swam into the trap are removed. Silicate concentrations are compared to prepared standards.\n\nCompleteness: Electronic Data Complications: Lotus 1-2-3 spreadsheets should be converted to Excel\n\nProcessing step (1991): IOS and POI (Vladivostok)",
